WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.602
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:03.803
We hope you're doing well
tonight.

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:05.405
And now we are going to
get to the news.

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:09.141
President Biden spoke today
about rising gasoline prices,

00:00:09.141 --> 00:00:12.244
but just because alternative
means of transportation

00:00:12.244 --> 00:00:13.446
aren't working out.

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:18.384
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:21.521
After President Biden fell off
his bike over the weekend,

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:24.123
former President Trump
said he will,

00:00:24.123 --> 00:00:26.359
"Never, ever ride a bicycle."

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:30.496
Oh, nobody thought
you were going to.

00:00:30.496 --> 00:00:33.466
I mean, at least
until you said you weren't.

00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:36.569
Because if this is anything
like your past promises,

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:38.538
you'll be in the Tour de France
next month.

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:40.406
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.406 --> 00:00:43.409
It did say Tour de France, Baze,
I apologize.

00:00:43.409 --> 00:00:46.178
I did it real fancy.

00:00:46.178 --> 00:00:47.814
Tour de "Frantz."

00:00:48.881 --> 00:00:50.517
That's the Tour de France.

00:00:50.517 --> 00:00:52.351
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.351 --> 00:00:54.721
Tour of -- It's the tour of --

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:57.289
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.289 --> 00:00:58.858
President Biden yesterday

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:01.861
signed two cybersecurity bills
into law.

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:03.863
Said Biden, "Hang on.
It's almost done.

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:05.432
Says all I got to do now is

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:08.668
enter my Social Security number
and mother's maiden name."

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:10.903
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.903 --> 00:01:13.206
President Biden today
asked Congress to approve

00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:15.741
a three-month pause
on the federal gas tax

00:01:15.741 --> 00:01:17.510
to help combat rising prices.

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:19.378
And at this point,
he'll try anything.

00:01:19.378 --> 00:01:22.548
Don't be surprised if he starts
giving the price in liters.

00:01:22.548 --> 00:01:26.286
"Got it down to a buck 39!

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:28.421
Nice."

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:30.823
During yesterday's hearing
on the Capitol attack,

00:01:30.823 --> 00:01:32.258
committee members showed texts

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:34.526
that indicated Republican
Senator Ron Johnson

00:01:34.526 --> 00:01:37.497
wanted to hand-deliver
a list of fake electors

00:01:37.497 --> 00:01:39.131
for then
Vice President Mike Pence

00:01:39.131 --> 00:01:40.766
to introduce on January sixth.

00:01:40.766 --> 00:01:44.137
You sent that over text?

00:01:44.137 --> 00:01:47.073
Dude, how do you send bribes,
Venmo?

00:01:47.073 --> 00:01:50.142
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.142 --> 00:01:52.244
In a new interview,
Hillary Clinton said

00:01:52.244 --> 00:01:54.147
that it would be
"out of the question"

00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:56.215
for her to run for
president in 2024.

00:01:56.215 --> 00:01:58.818
Oh, I wait. I read that wrong.
The interviewer said that.

00:01:58.818 --> 00:02:00.652
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.652 --> 00:02:04.957
The mayor of Moffat, Colorado,
which has 70 dispensaries

00:02:04.957 --> 00:02:07.160
but only 120 residents...

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:09.061
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.061 --> 00:02:11.330
...said in a new interview
that she is considering

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:14.199
changing the name of the town
to Kush.

00:02:14.199 --> 00:02:16.669
Said residents, "Yeah, we know.

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:19.305
You said the same thing
like 20 minutes ago."

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:21.507
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.507 --> 00:02:23.609
Authorities in New York City
yesterday

00:02:23.609 --> 00:02:26.846
crushed nearly 100 illegal
dirt bikes with a bulldozer.

00:02:26.846 --> 00:02:30.249
And 6-year-olds don't know
how to feel about it.

00:02:30.249 --> 00:02:34.520
"I mean, I love dirt bikes,
but I also love bulldozers."

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:37.356
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.356 --> 00:02:40.226
That's my 6-year-old impression.
"Come on!"

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:44.297
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.297 --> 00:02:46.031
Health officials in New Jersey
this week

00:02:46.031 --> 00:02:48.634
discovered their first
suspected case of monkeypox.

00:02:48.634 --> 00:02:50.636
And because it's Jersey,
you know

00:02:50.636 --> 00:02:53.172
that's going to be
that guy's nickname forever.

00:02:53.172 --> 00:02:55.741
[ Laughter ]
"Hey, oh, Monkeypox,

00:02:55.741 --> 00:02:57.143
we're getting beers.

00:02:57.143 --> 00:02:59.578
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.578 --> 00:03:01.481
You're paying, Monkeypox."

00:03:01.481 --> 00:03:06.351
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.351 --> 00:03:09.121
And finally, the food company
Kraft announced today

00:03:09.121 --> 00:03:12.191
that it's changing the name of
its popular macaroni and cheese

00:03:12.191 --> 00:03:13.492
to Mac and Cheese,

00:03:13.492 --> 00:03:15.694
while the people who eat it
for dinner every night

00:03:15.694 --> 00:03:17.630
will still be known
as Kraft Singles.

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:18.798
Aw, Goldich.

00:03:18.798 --> 00:03:21.433
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.433 --> 00:03:23.269
Matthew Goldich, how...?

00:03:23.269 --> 00:03:26.972
[ Laughter ]

00:03:26.972 --> 00:03:29.008
Oh, I feel like that guy
is going to meet somebody.

00:03:29.008 --> 00:03:30.743
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

